{"screen_name": "hagi_waka", "file": "hagi_waka", "name": "矢矧稚彦🔞次はせんアカ15", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1843979324145512448/v0sJGiq3.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1600638163/1746583299/1500x500", "description": "やはぎわかひこ。お仕事はDMかメールにて。18歳未満の閲覧・フォロー禁止 各種ﾘﾝｸ→ https://skeb.jp/@hagi_waka / http://fantia.jp/fanclubs/34891 / https://hagi-waka.fanbox.cc/", "first_seen": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00"}], "comic": [{"amount": 28000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00"}], "correction": [{"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 15000, "comic": 28000, "correction": 10000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 15000, "max": 15000}, "comic": {"min": 28000, "max": 28000}, "correction": {"min": 10000, "max": 10000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/hagi_waka", "name": "hagi_waka"}, {"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@hagi_waka", "name": "hagi_waka"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://hagi-waka.fanbox.cc", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/8628344", "name": "8628344"}, {"label": "Fantia", "url": "https://fantia.jp/fanclubs/34891", "name": "34891"}], "works": [{"path": "/@hagi_waka/works/62", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a0307ab1/uploads/origins/f293dbf9-d9fd-42bd-979b-480b5850eb57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eef43fb21b0ad2de0a3f8ef0da1b9b56", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a0307ab1/uploads/origins/f293dbf9-d9fd-42bd-979b-480b5850eb57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eef43fb21b0ad2de0a3f8ef0da1b9b56, https://si.imgix.net/a0307ab1/uploads/origins/f293dbf9-d9fd-42bd-979b-480b5850eb57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cfb36e476c5ee3ed1a0313f13131f8f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a0307ab1/uploads/origins/f293dbf9-d9fd-42bd-979b-480b5850eb57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=208a6dbbd9c694db7cc1f09b90505c78 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "露天風呂（深さ20cmぐらい）に連れてこられて写真を撮られるv_flowerをおねがいいたします\n\n【キャラクター】\nv_flower\n\n【シチュエーション】\n- 温泉に行くとだけ聞かされてうっきうきで饒舌のv_flower\n- しかし連れてこられた温泉は、温泉とは名ばかりの道端にある水たまり（深さ20cmぐらい。ご丁寧に露天風呂(温泉)・タオル禁止の看板がある）だった。マジでドン引き\n- エロ蹲踞&Wピースで写真を撮られるv_flower。女性器は水に沈めて何とかギリギリ隠している。キレた笑顔", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hagi_waka/works/61", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/54b443a8/uploads/origins/6fc6e074-00a3-4b93-8a25-d0ef276e6695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ce0fc207338e914984ecebf08a3283fe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/54b443a8/uploads/origins/6fc6e074-00a3-4b93-8a25-d0ef276e6695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ce0fc207338e914984ecebf08a3283fe, https://si.imgix.net/54b443a8/uploads/origins/6fc6e074-00a3-4b93-8a25-d0ef276e6695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bb2fd31d5d615dd653ee42170ba9991b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/54b443a8/uploads/origins/6fc6e074-00a3-4b93-8a25-d0ef276e6695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=85655a79e2259fe21ac36c35a1c2c3ec 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"pa